              "id": "text-14",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Carbon Steel H-11 | UNS# T20811, also known as Tool Steel H11 is a chromium-based steel alloy in the “H” family of steels according to the AISI classification system. One of the more commonly used alloys in the “H” family, H-11 demonstrates excellent impact toughness, excellent resistance to cracking, and thermal fatigue cracking. Because of these desirable traits, H-11 is often used in the aerospace industry for landing gear, blades for rotorcraft and shafts, die-casting dies and similar applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Carbon Steel H-11 Specifications:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "AMS: AMS 6485, AMS 6487, AMS 6488"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Carbon Steel H-11 product forms offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Carbon Steel H-11 Round Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-carbon-steel-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Please find Titanium Industries’ inventory of [Carbon Steel Round Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-carbon-steel-round-bar) here."
